{"id":"16686ac2c7343b20","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-orey-undecidable.md","title":"Orey Sentences Are Independent","display":"thm-orey-undecidable — Orey Sentences Are Independent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-orey-undecidable","aliases":["67-thm-orey-undecidable"],"display":"thm-orey-undecidable — Orey Sentences Are Independent","depends_on":["[[67-df-orey-sentence]]","[[67-thm-interpretability]]","[[67-df-consistent]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 82；PDF 第 93 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"已核对来源结论并完成上述一致性转移的本地证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-orey-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-orey-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-orey-undecidable — Orey Sentences Are Independent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82b758f400b1bec\" href=\"?note=b82b758f400b1bec\" title=\"67-df-orey-sentence\">67-df-orey-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11cf093a6460aae2\" href=\"?note=11cf093a6460aae2\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability\">67-thm-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 82；PDF 第 93 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"已核对来源结论并完成上述一致性转移的本地证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为有效呈现的一致算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orey}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Orey}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82b758f400b1bec\" href=\"?note=b82b758f400b1bec\" title=\"67-df-orey-sentence\">67-df-orey-sentence</a>；外部一致性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma))\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma))\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源在 Orey 句定义后说其在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中不可判定。这里展开依赖：两侧解释和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致先推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\sigma\">\\(T+\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\sigma\">\\(T+\\neg\\sigma\\)</span> 都一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明任一侧，另一侧扩张即不一致，矛盾。</p>\n<p>一致性前提显式保留；不一致理论中定义本身不排除 Orey 句，因而不能无条件推出不可判定。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 82；PDF 第 93 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对来源结论并完成上述一致性转移的本地证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-orey-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b82b758f400b1bec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-orey-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"11cf093a6460aae2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-orey-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b82b758f400b1bec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orey}_T$ 取 [[67-df-orey-sentence]]；外部一致性谓词 $\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 取 [[67-df-consistent]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orey}_T$ 取 [[67-df-orey-sentence]]；外部一致性谓词 $\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 取 [[67-df-consistent]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orey}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land\\mathrm{Orey}_T(\\sigma))\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash\\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg\\sigma\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1605,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-orey-undecidable]]"}],"outgoing":["b82b758f400b1bec","11cf093a6460aae2","9f0e08fd1022847c"]}